      "trigger": "A surviving reviewer has the Windows command line `codex.exe -c \"developer_instructions=\\\"please app-server check\\\"\" exec --json -`, and its parent is a dead, unrecorded intermediate process, leaving the machine-wide scan responsible for detecting it.",
